model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Catalog hints may explain an empty tool section only when the active app still declares its requirement and method, linked-account state is known, that method is absent, and the live section has no tools or discovery error. Connection actions use the existing account dialog with the actual app and requirement; current host policy and server authorization remain authoritative. Search filtering never changes this decision. Catalog guidance does not declare credentials or alter saved accounts."
    }
  }
}
